# package generics

A generic record's fields and a generic `impl`'s members are checked per
instance, so `-doc` reads their visibility from what is written.

## Pair

```loke
Pair :: struct($T: type) {
	// The left one.
	left: T,
	// and fields private to the package
}
```

A pair of one type.

## Box

```loke
Box :: struct($T: type) {
	// and fields private to the package
}
```

Opaque to importers.

## Pair($T).first

```loke
first :: proc(self) -> T
```

The left one again.
